  "notable_quotes": [
    "Most MOFs with high C2H6/C2H4 selectivity have low C2H2 uptake, so they are insufficient for efficient one-step C2H2/C2H4/C2H6 separation.",
    "Adjacent uncoordinated carboxylate-O sites act as strong binding sites, driving preferential adsorption of C2H6 and C2H2 over C2H4.",
    "HIAM-210 combines a 4.02 Å pore size with a tailored pore environment, giving C2H2/C2H4 and C2H6/C2H4 selectivities of 2.0 each."
